                  "text": "22:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ri malaika ma kitipa pa jom'oyeyo ma Simirina ndiki ama: Me mikwenda ma wok bongi ŋati marapena kendo macowe, m'otho aka doko onyo kwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋeyo candirok kodi candi perin; aŋeyo nike ijacandi, to iy'adieri iŋaŋ! Aŋeyo reco ma joma ŋoyo nike jobedo Joyuda ma to kere jok'obedo, jotimo rin; meno joma nitie iy'acel gi Sitan! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikir'ilwor candirok macegin bino rin. Awaco rin ni, jwogi bino bolo megi kwoŋ win i jiera paka karatem; candirok mewin bino cowo ndelo apar. Bedi gi genirok tundo tho, aka abino miyin sangaria ma kwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
