        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ri malaika ma kitipa pa jom'oyeyo ma Perigamo ndiki ama: Me mikwenda ma wok bongi ŋata nitie g'abor mabith ma nyalewe ario. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋeyo ni kam'ibed'iye, a kama Sitan ojeng'iye kom pere ma dhum. T'icwire i nyingan, aka ikiweyo medirok gi yeyo perin kwoŋan kada i ndir ma Antipa, jakony paran m'ogenere onek'iye i tindi mewin kenyo kama Sitan bed'iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
